Spec: Experimental pending grant request values

Purpose:
  Describe a bounded explicit application and remote service permission request without granting access.

Owns:
  ./PendingGrantRequest.cs

References:
  /docs/adr/0012-pending-grant-requests.md

Must:
  Require an application UUID, declared import alias, opaque device reference, publisher application ID and service ID.
  Normalize an omitted reason to an empty string and bound it to `256` Unicode scalars without control characters or invalid UTF-16.
  Reject unknown or duplicate fields, including policy, credential and caller-identity override fields.
  Validate pending receipts and request status as exact shapes; neither represents an active grant.
